<title>USA: Black Rock Golf names Chris Cooper COO.</title>
<headline>Black Rock Golf names Chris Cooper COO.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colorado 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Black Rock Golf Corp said Wednesday it had named Chris Cooper as chief operating officer of the company.  </p>
<p>It said Cooper worked for Square 2 Golf in Fairfield, New Jersey, where he held a number of posts including chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Black Rock, which designs and markets golf equipment, did not say who he was replacing.</p>
